# CI, deploy and the secret-scanning rules: a change here can switch off a check or reach the test server or
# production (the release gate scripts/receive-release.sh, the deploy scripts, the image build, and ops/ with the
# server setup and the autopilot), so it gets a review from one of us. GitHub requests the review automatically;
# making it required needs a branch ruleset, which is only available once the repo is public (or on a paid plan).
/.github/        @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
/.gitleaks.toml  @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
/scripts/receive-release.sh  @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
/scripts/receive-deploy.sh   @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
/scripts/deploy.sh           @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
/docker-bake.hcl             @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
/Dockerfile                  @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
/ops/                        @janik-sauerbier @timgutberlet
